-- P7 (migration 013): the chat data layer. get_chat_context, start_chat_turn, finish_chat_turn, record_request_usage and
-- get_conversation_history: every function's success and refusal (ownership is RB037 and never says which side was wrong,
-- bad arguments are 22023, missing settings RB036, a repeated turn RB030); the source checks of finish_chat_turn (a chunk
-- of another bot, of another version, too many, oversized fields); history paging and its has_more flag; the new
-- message_sources columns and their member reads; grants, lock_timeout and schema_version. All fixtures are synthetic.
-- Sequential only: the real two-connection races are in scripts/race-db.sh.
